---
import { HEATMAPS } from "../config";
---

<section id="map-proof" class="map-proof section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="map-proof__head">
      <p class="eyebrow map-proof__eyebrow">Map proof</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">#1 on the map where the money is.</h2>
      <p class="map-proof__blurb">
        These are BrightLocal ranking grids for The Mounting Man, my Twin Cities company. Each circle is a spot on the map, and the number is where we come up on Google Maps when someone searches from there. On the high-ticket searches (Samsung Frame installation, mantel mount installation, corporate TV mounting, and TV mounting service Minneapolis) we're #1 at all 81 points. The broad searches are where everyone competes, and we still hold #1 across the core of the metro. The two orange spots on the "near me" map, around Apple Valley and Rosemount, are zip codes we don't chase because they don't produce high-ticket jobs. We put the effort where the money is, and that's what I'll show you how to do in your trade.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="map-proof__grid" style={`--cols:${HEATMAPS.length}`}>
      {HEATMAPS.map((m) => (
        <figure class="map-proof__card">
          {m.src ? (
            <a href={m.src} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label={`Open full-size ${m.keyword} heat map`}><img src={m.src} alt={`BrightLocal heat map for "${m.keyword}" — ${m.caption}`} loading="lazy" /></a>
          ) : (
            <div class="map-proof__slot" aria-hidden="true">Heat map screenshot</div>
          )}
          <figcaption>
            <span class="map-proof__kw">"{m.keyword}"</span>
            <span class="map-proof__cap">{m.caption}</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .map-proof {
    background: var(--white);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
  }
  .map-proof__head {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-7);
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }
  .map-proof__eyebrow { color: var(--muted); }
  .map-proof__blurb {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--font-body);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .map-proof__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(min(var(--cols, 3), 3), 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-5);
    max-width: calc(min(var(--cols, 3), 3) * 340px);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .map-proof__card {
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #fafafa;
  }
  .map-proof__card img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    object-fit: contain;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .map-proof__slot {
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--font-small);
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #f3f3f3, #f3f3f3 12px, #ececec 12px, #ececec 24px);
  }
  .map-proof__card figcaption {
    padding: var(--space-4);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .map-proof__kw { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  .map-proof__cap { font-size: var(--font-small); color: var(--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .map-proof__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
